  "question": {
    "text": "Let $\\hat{a}$ be a unit vector perpendicular to the vectors $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{b}}=\\hat{i}-2 \\hat{j}+3 \\hat{k}$ and $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{c}}=2 \\hat{i}+3 \\hat{j}-\\hat{k}$, and makes an angle of $\\cos ^{-1}\\left(-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)$ with the vector $\\hat{i}+\\hat{j}+\\hat{k}$. If $\\hat{\\mathrm{a}}$ makes an angle of $\\frac{\\pi}{3}$ with the vector $\\hat{i}+\\alpha \\hat{j}+\\hat{k}$, then the value of $\\alpha$ is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "ULzKM",
      "text": "$\\sqrt{6}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "A0vDA",
      "text": "$-\\sqrt{6}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "L6Rjw",
      "text": "$-\\sqrt{3}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MsaOg",
      "text": "$\\sqrt{3}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}\n\\hat{i} & \\hat{j} & \\hat{k} \\\\\n1 & -2 & 3 \\\\\n2 & 3 & -1\n\\end{array}\\right|=\\hat{i}(-7)+7 \\hat{j}+7 \\hat{k} \\\\\n& \\hat{a}= \\pm \\frac{(-7 \\hat{i}+7 \\hat{j}+7 \\hat{k})}{\\sqrt{7^2+7^2+7^2}}= \\pm\\left(\\frac{-\\hat{i}+\\hat{j}+\\hat{k}}{\\sqrt{3}}\\right)\n\\end{aligned}$\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text { Now, } \\cos \\theta= \\pm \\frac{(-1+1+1)}{\\sqrt{3} \\cdot \\sqrt{3}}= \\pm \\frac{1}{3} \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\cos ^{-1}\\left(\\frac{-1}{3}\\right) \\Rightarrow \\hat{a}=\\frac{-(-\\hat{i}+\\hat{j}+\\hat{k})}{\\sqrt{3}} \\\\\n& \\hat{a}=\\frac{\\hat{i}-\\hat{j}-\\hat{k}}{\\sqrt{3}}\n\\end{aligned}$\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\cos \\frac{\\pi}{3}=\\frac{1-\\alpha-1}{\\sqrt{3} \\cdot \\sqrt{\\alpha^2+2}} \\\\\n& \\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{-\\alpha}{\\sqrt{3} \\cdot \\sqrt{\\alpha^2+2}} \\rightarrow \\alpha < 0 \\\\\n& 3\\left(\\alpha^2+2\\right)=4 \\alpha^2 \\\\\n& 6=\\alpha^2 \\\\\n& \\alpha= \\pm \\sqrt{6}\n\\end{aligned}$\n\nClearly, $\\alpha=-\\sqrt{6}$",
    "image": null
  },
